# Allow-list: the image gets only what SPM needs to run. Everything else in a
# working checkout (.env, database dumps, reports, logs, private notes) stays out,
# whatever it is called.
*

!requirements.txt
!VERSION
!LICENSE
!CREDITS.md
!README.md
!config/
!core/
!evennia_world/
!proxy/
!scripts/
!spm/
!docs/troubleshooting.md

# Never inside an allowed folder either: user settings and caches.
config/config.local.json
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.log
